---
const points = [
  {
    glyph: '{≠}',
    label: 'Not a chatbot',
    title: 'Answers that stay.',
    body: 'A chat answer scrolls away. An abject is a running object with a window, a mailbox, and its own source. Close the chat and it keeps working: refreshing the tide chart, feeding the fish, watching the inbox.',
  },
  {
    glyph: '{∅}',
    label: 'Not an agent framework',
    title: 'No top. No bottom.',
    body: 'Agent frameworks put a planner on top and tools underneath. Here every piece, the tools included, is an object that can be asked what it does and can ask back. The LLM is a service an object calls when it needs to think, and it is silent the rest of the time.',
  },
  {
    glyph: '{⋈}',
    label: 'Not a cloud',
    title: 'Your key is your address.',
    body: 'No accounts. Your machine generates its own cryptographic name, peers find each other over encrypted WebRTC, and a goal started here survives on every peer that joined it. Nobody rents you your own software.',
  },
];
---

<section id="why" class="why-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">How is Abject different?</h2>
    <p class="why-subtitle">
      Engineers know the shape by name: the actor model, with one house rule Erlang never had.
      Every actor answers <em>ask</em>.
    </p>

    <div class="why-grid grid-3">
      {points.map((p) => (
        <div class="card why-card">
          <div class="why-head">
            <span class="why-glyph">{p.glyph}</span>
            <span class="why-label">{p.label}</span>
          </div>
          <h3>{p.title}</h3>
          <p>{p.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="why-cta">
      <a href="/why" class="btn btn-outline">The full comparison &rarr;</a>
      <a href="/ask-protocol" class="btn btn-outline">The Ask Protocol &rarr;</a>
      <a href="/theory" class="btn btn-outline">The theory &rarr;</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: -1.5rem auto 2.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .why-subtitle em {
    color: var(--eldritch);
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .why-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .why-glyph {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--eldritch);
    background: var(--eldritch-glow);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-accent);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .why-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .why-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .why-card p {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .why-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }
</style>
